{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/shell/src/bot/RateCard.svelte","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-01T22:47:23.095423Z","id":"b3b0cff09e5ebfec68cbb6f52ba635a0908aed9b0c351c7e995fa8bb1b9d1594","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"731c17bf5afb18ca271ca7a1ef73b5bee3130ad522f415891b5bb89704cb4222","summary":"Fixed in 998ba1bab: a unit that is not cost-based (new, fixed, default-priced) starts at the token margin from GET pricing's token_margin_bp, and a default-priced one with a blank cost. Test: 'starts a default-priced model's card at its fixed credits, and at the token margin once a unit is cost-based' (token_margin_bp 3500).","tags":["session:claude-code:f97e2315-5ffc-47c7-94a0-050e4e7b9835"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/shell/src/bot/fixtures.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-01T22:47:23.096331Z","id":"05fb614c03b8757952307c9344109bc6775aa78fa2e029537a0599c1563df565","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"4f36ec9093cd37fa1be4d875c712d0f54287dc0cccf0054a35b26359ebefcc7f","summary":"Fixed in 998ba1bab: pricing() builds `lines` from its models' line-sourced units as the store does (`<model>.<unit>`, '<name> <unit> tokens'), so the Remove fixture drops the deleted lines. Added tests: Save sends no token lines, Save while a card POST is pending, Edit on a default-priced model, Cancel returning focus; the name fallback is gone with nameOf.","tags":["session:claude-code:f97e2315-5ffc-47c7-94a0-050e4e7b9835"]}}
