{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/shell/src/bot/AdminPricing.svelte","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-01T23:14:18.144888Z","id":"7f51d25f5b846af60f8faedd2debc9dc71360c7a5b85da11bf8839af692f3355","body":{"detail":"Failure: Remove on a model listed only because it has token lines (tiers []), with require_explicit_price off. pricing_view lists the tier models plus models with a token line (priced_models, crates/clax-server/src/routes/admin.rs:719-722), so the answer no longer lists the model; resolvesTo(x, model) finds no entry and falls to 'no price: runs on it are refused'. The confirm before it (next(m), line 97) says the right thing. The Remove tests use claude-sonnet-5-5, a tier model, so none covers this.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":99},"end":{"line":102},"content_hash":"79b60e1eb0827219497df72495632497b3ccaf9a1d1f02e27438e134c395c1dd"},"suggested_fix":"Use next(m), computed before the DELETE, when the answer no longer lists the model (or always); add a test removing a tierless model's card.","summary":"After removing the rate card of a model in no tier, the note says its runs are refused, though its tokens go to tokenulator.dev's price or the default rates","tags":["review","pricing","session:claude-code:f97e2315-5ffc-47c7-94a0-050e4e7b9835"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/shell/src/bot/AdminPricing.svelte","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-01T23:16:18.900147Z","id":"31a0d43c0d2b91a28dc2f3521411371e4557aeecc909a9205185b36aad1591d6","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"7f51d25f5b846af60f8faedd2debc9dc71360c7a5b85da11bf8839af692f3355","summary":"Fixed in b294a573b: remove() computes next(m) before the DELETE and the after-note uses it when the answered pricing no longer lists the model (resolvesTo's 'was'). Test: 'says what charges a model in no tier once its card is removed, though the pricing no longer lists it' in web/shell/src/bot/admin.test.ts; just web-test: //web:unit PASSED (2720 tests).","tags":["session:claude-code:f97e2315-5ffc-47c7-94a0-050e4e7b9835"]}}
